## Development

All tools run in Docker. `make verify` runs every check; CI runs the same command.

```sh
make install-hooks   # block commits with secrets, personal paths, databases or logs
make verify          # lint, types, tests, coverage, architecture and security checks
```

See `AGENTS.md` for the rules the checks enforce.
